    "long_instructions": "## Comment the Code\r\n\r\nWith the help of AI, figure out what each code snippet in `script.js` is doing. Add in a comment above each code snippet to explain what it does.\r\n\r\n:::details [How do I add a comment?]\r\nYou can add a comment in JavaScript by putting two forward slashes `//` before the text you want to comment out.\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n```\r\n// Creates name variable\r\nname = \"Shelby\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n:::",
